54eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/covalent-bond-types.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Bond order is at most 3 (limited by linking sites). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Organic.CovalentBond.order_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Organic.CovalentBond.order_pos","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/covalent-bond-types.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Bond order is at least 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Organic.CovalentBond.order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Organic.CovalentBond.order","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/covalent-bond-types.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Bond order: number of shared Hopf links (1 = single, 2 = double, 3 = triple). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Organic.CovalentBond.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Organic.CovalentBond.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/covalent-bond-types.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Organic.CovalentBond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Organic.CovalentBond","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/covalent-bond-types.lean#L19-L29","doc":"A covalent bond of order `k` between two atoms.\nEach shared Hopf link contributes `E_cross(T(2,2))` to the\ncrossing energy, plus pairwise inter-link interactions. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:covalent-bond-types","label":"def:covalent-bond-types","md":"quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/covalent-bond-types.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}